W9oa8BHTQQNCkQ3IcHCLQBKBI",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:OTHER_DIETARY_RESTRICTIONS"],"特殊餐點",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjWmuubwNKWAxW9oa8BHTQQNCkQ3YcHCLcBKAA"],[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjWmuubwNKWAxW9oa8BHTQQNCkQ3YcHCLgBKAE"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjWmuubwNKWAxW9oa8BHTQQNCkQ3IcHCLYBKBM",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["台灣少見主打煮干拉麵的店家，另外還有魚干醋可以調味，煮干湯頭還可以選擇濃厚或淡麗，濃厚版本魚干味相當濃郁，有小魚干的香氣和甜味，苦味也不會過重，是很不錯的味道，不過稍油；喜歡清淡的朋友則表示淡麗版本可以接受。\n\n至於叉燒飯真的有點偏鹹，希望店家能稍做調整，煮干系拉麵在台灣相當小眾，接受度也遠不如雞白湯那麼高，但仍然有他的魅力在，所以我覺得能堅持這條路的店家真的值得鼓勵，至少比很多一味跟風的店更值得被大家看見，尤其是開在淡水，價格整體也不算貴，希望老闆能撐下去，加油！",null,[0,104]]]],[null,1770801371000000,1770801371000000,"6 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfNVlXaE5NT0p0a2hXTnNWQmlxVDVFdw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfNVlXaE5NT0p0a2hXTnNWQmlxVDVFdxoTQ2d3STI1R3h6QVlRaHBEenZBRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjWmuubwNKWAxW9oa8BHTQQNCkQ_2MIuQEoFA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11284795925912942161/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvVDJWWGRHcE9NV2hHVjFjeFNFMXJOVWxPU0ZWNVYyNUtjVlpXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11284795925912942161/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvVDJWWGRHcE9NV2hHVjFjeFNFMXJOVWxPU0ZWNVYyNUtjVlpXUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11284795925912942161/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvVDJWWGRHcE9NV2hHVjFjeFNFMXJOVWxPU0ZWNVYyNUtjVlpXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11284795925912942161/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvVDJWWGRHcE9NV2hHVjFjeFNFMXJOVWxPU0ZWNVYyNUtjVlpXUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11284795925912942161/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvVDJWWGRHcE9NV2hHVjFjeFNFMXJOV